import json
S='NiagaraToolsets.NiagaraToolset_System.'
SYS={'refPath':'/Game/FX/NS_JamHitSparks.NS_JamHitSparks'}
def ref(em,script='',module='',ri=-1,stack=None):
    return {'system':SYS,'emitterName':em,'scriptName':script,'moduleName':module,'rendererIndex':ri,'inputNameStack':stack or []}
def call(n,a):
    return execute_tool(S+n, json.dumps(a))
def run():
    call('RemoveEmitter',{'emitterToRemove':ref('RibbonTrailFollower')})
    call('RemoveEmitter',{'emitterToRemove':ref('Ribbon_Trail_Leader')})
    t=call('GetEmitterInputValues',{'emitterRef':ref('OmnidirectionalBurst')}) if False else None
    return {'topo':call('GetEmitterTopology',{'emitterRef':ref('OmnidirectionalBurst')})}

